{"id":"5017","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5017_main_drifting-snow-and-snowdrifts_hydrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>强风将积雪从<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雪堆</span>中提升到很低的高度。眼睛的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">水平能见度</span>没有明显减弱，因此这被称为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">低吹雪</span>。</p>\n<p>在图片的最右侧，积雪上方的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雪粒</span>的高度稍高，但这仅仅是因为雪表面的高度较低，这仅仅是局部效应。这里高于地面的凸起积雪高度不能代表整个景观。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国英格兰西约克郡伯利摩尔","latitude":"纬度: 53° 53' 12'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 45' 33'' W","date":"24 March 2013 1200 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.11.3.1"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5018_main_snow-drifts-and-drifting-snow_hydrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张照片显示英国英格兰西约克郡Rombalds Moor靠着一个干石墙的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">雪堆</span>。在空旷的田野上显示出<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">未被风吹起的雪</span>。在背景中，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>处是被强风吹起升高到地面以上不高位置的雪粒。被风吹起的雪粒并没有明显地减弱眼睛的水平能见度，因此这被归类为低吹雪，而不是高吹雪。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国伊尔克利Menston","latitude":"纬度: 53° 52' 60'' N","longitude":"经度: 1° 45' 53'' W","date":"24 March 2013 1300 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.11.3.1"}]}]}